{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124237","id":4763818233,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABG_IY-Q","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124237","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124237.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124237.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124237","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124237/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124237/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124237/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/5e86f7cee58538e17a324177883866507c8b3008","number":124237,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Skip saving unchanged text resources when loading from disk.","user":{"login":"ALiwoto","id":70187458,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwMTg3NDU4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/70187458?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ALiwoto","html_url":"https://github.com/ALiwoto","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ALiwoto/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ALiwoto/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ALiwoto/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ALiwoto/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ALiwoto/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ALiwoto/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ALiwoto/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ALiwoto/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ALiwoto/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nGodot's text resource loader would mistakenly mark a **loaded/reloaded** resource (from disk) as edited, which would cause it to save a newer version of the scene file with lots of default values to the disk. In my project, this was causing massive git diffs without me ever touching those files.\r\n\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nThe binary resource loader ([ResourceLoaderBinary::load](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/f3035aad5625f96b624559378acf5b86d5c32e01/core/io/resource_format_binary.cpp#L618)), already [has](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/f3035aad5625f96b624559378acf5b86d5c32e01/core/io/resource_format_binary.cpp#L821) this code:\r\n```cpp\r\n#ifdef TOOLS_ENABLED\r\n\t\tres->set_edited(false);\r\n#endif\r\n```\r\n\r\nthis prevents it from re-saving a just-loaded/reloaded resources back to disk. The text resource loader lacks this.\r\n\r\nThe change inside of the `core/io/resource.cpp` file also fixes the same issue but in the [hot reload path](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/f3035aad5625f96b624559378acf5b86d5c32e01/core/io/resource.cpp#L263).\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":410064485,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw0MTAwNjQ0ODU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/needs%20testing","name":"needs testing","description":"","color":"ffcc44","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https:/